    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d815">

                <pb facs="1032" n="936" xml:id="pg936"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Day to Mr. Hay.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-10-27"><hi rendition="#italic">October 27,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 17.]</seg></opener>
                <p>Pursuant to offer approved by you and afterwards made by us to Spanish
                    Commissioners, we contemplate insertion in the treaty, unless otherwise
                    instructed, of the following clause: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>The United States assumes and will discharge the obligations resting upon
                            it under international law for the protection of life and property in
                            the island of Cuba during its occupation thereof.</p>
                    </quote></p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Day.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
